invariant: INV-4
file: srv_flight.c
catches: test/lib-check-rand-session.sh
reason: srv_begin draws the server's x25519 scalar from ch_rand_bytes, with
  a declaration of its own because a RAND=session build's rand.h declares
  none. The RAND=session object then imports a hook no image of such
  objects defines, so an image that links only RAND=session objects fails
  to link. lib-check's counterpart of the RAND=extern import check refuses
  an object that names ch_rand_bytes at all.

--- old
    rand_draw(&h->t->cfg, h->priv, sizeof h->priv);
--- new
    void ch_rand_bytes(uint8_t *p, size_t n);
    ch_rand_bytes(h->priv, sizeof h->priv);
